UID:daylight-saving-time-ends-20261101@todaycelebrates.com
DTSTAMP:20261014T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
SUMMARY:Daylight Saving Time Ends
DESCRIPTION:Daylight Saving Time ends on the first Sunday in November\, whe
 n clocks across most of the United States are set back one hour at 2:00 a.
 m. daylight time\, which becomes 1:00 a.m. standard time. The schedule is 
 federal law rather than custom: the dates have been fixed in the U.S. Code
  since 1966 and have taken their present form since 2007. Hawaii and most 
 of Arizona never moved their clocks forward in March\, so they have nothin
 g to set back.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/daylight-saving-time
 -ends/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/daylight-saving-time-ends
 /
CATEGORIES:Celebration
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
