SUMMARY:Patriot Day — National Day of Service & Remembrance
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
DESCRIPTION:Patriot Day falls on September 11 and honors the 2\,977 people 
 killed in the terrorist attacks of 2001. Congress designated it by joint r
 esolution in December of that year\, which means the first Patriot Day was
  September 11\, 2002. It is a day of remembrance and\, since 2009\, of ser
 vice\; it is not a holiday\, and nothing closes.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrate
 s.com/holiday/patriot-day-national-day-of-service-and-remembrance/
